> and we do know that graphics controllers have an initialization routine,
> but I can't think of anything else that I'm aware of doing that.  That's
> definitely going to be something to keep in mind, though ...

SRM emulates enough of a PC to get most graphics cards going, but it
doesn't seem to run the BIOS code of other cards.

