On 2005-02-10,  DiskMan <nobody@thewheel.com> wrote:
> As for CCC being better than GCC, the older versions were, the newer
> releases of GCC are a different matter. CCC hasn't been updated since
> GCC-2.96 and doesn't run with anything but GCC-2.96... About the only thing
> CCC has going for it is the GEM backend. In certain tasks it would be faster
